 "_doc": "Kai !Garib LM (Kakamas). Statement print shared with Kopanong: ledger 'Belastingfaktuur / Tax invoice | Datum | Beskrywing | Heffing | BTW | Bedrag' (Afrikaans or English per bill), a 'Meterlesings / Meter readings' table (type, previous date + reading, current date + reading, consumption; the meter number sits on the 'Mtr:' line above its row) and a property box. Only 2 bills (2020, two sites). total_ex_vat_r = sum of the Charge column of the Elektrisiteit / Electricity ledger lines; no basic/energy split is printed, so it is all mapped to standard_r (single-band). Readings, kWh and period from the E row; site = Ligging/Location + Uitbreiding/Extension; deposit printed as a credit and stored as the held amount. Water, vacuum tank (sewer), refuse and rates rows from their lines. Fingerprint: own VAT number (masthead) + name/e-mail domain. IDENTITY kg_identity_r = printed Totals charge column - every non-electricity charge line: 0.00 on 2/2 (a ledger-completeness check; the electricity split itself is by label), 0 checks.",
